Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.56,0:00:03.08,DefaultItalics,SIGN & VO,0,0,0,,Do you know the legend?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.08,0:00:04.98,DefaultItalics,SIGN & VO,0,0,0,,I heard something wild about payphones.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.98,0:00:07.58,DefaultItalics,SIGN & VO,0,0,0,,If you answer the call, \Nyou'll be taken to paradise.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.58,0:00:08.71,DefaultItalics,SIGN & VO,0,0,0,,For real?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.49,0:00:11.66,DefaultItalics,SIGN & VO,0,0,0,,Payphones are such a vibe.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.08,0:00:13.86,DefaultItalics,SIGN & VO,0,0,0,,Do they still have those?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.49,0:00:16.99,DefaultItalics,SIGN & VO,0,0,0,,I learned how to use them in grade school.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.99,0:00:19.50,DefaultItalicsTop,SIGN & VO,0,0,0,,I saw that on TV. \NPeople have already disappeared.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.26,0:02:03.27,Signs_EpTitle,SIGN,0,0,0,,{\fad(525,523)\an9\blur2\fs18\pos(600.857,277.714)}Episode 6  {\fs24}Memory
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.56,0:02:04.23,FlashbackTop,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,He's not the Tatsuo-kun you knew anymore.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.07,0:02:08.25,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Hardly any of his consciousness \Nor memories are left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.25,0:02:12.11,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,I doubt he'll ever be that person again.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.26,0:02:14.45,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Tatsuo...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:17.38,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Hiryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.12,0:02:20.05,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Come join us.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.83,0:02:23.84,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Take Tatsuo's mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.74,0:02:29.38,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,It's got some kind of flute built in \N that the giant worm doesn't like.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.68,0:02:33.65,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,If we can get our hands on it, \Nwe can get to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.65,0:02:37.85,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Shouldn't we do something \Nbefore we're attacked again?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.85,0:02:41.04,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,I guess it beats sitting around here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.04,0:02:43.85,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,But how are we going to take his mask?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.10,0:02:47.79,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,We can't move in the first place \Nbecause of the worm.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.15,0:02:51.25,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Someone will need to draw \Nthe worm's attention.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.25,0:02:53.86,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,The rest of us will take his mask.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.14,0:02:58.83,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Then I'm going to Tatsuo. \NI won't take no for an answer.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.83,0:03:00.09,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Asaga-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.60,0:03:04.11,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,I'll do my job. \NThis is something I have to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.11,0:03:05.21,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.39,0:03:05.75,DefaultOverlap,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.75,0:03:07.75,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,I'm going with you, Hiryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.75,0:03:10.46,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Then there's nothing to worry about. \NRight, Amamiya?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.46,0:03:13.81,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Ow, ow, ow!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.86,0:03:14.11,DefaultOverlap,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,That'll make me worry even more.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.11,0:03:15.25,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Why?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.25,0:03:17.98,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,I already made up my mind. \NHiryu and I are going.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.98,0:03:19.47,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Don't be ridiculous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.47,0:03:21.47,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You're the one acting ridiculous!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.47,0:03:24.14,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Are you planning to die \Nwhile protecting us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.38,0:03:29.09,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You can act tough all you want,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.09,0:03:32.37,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,but even an idiot can see \Nwhat state you're in.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.17,0:03:37.07,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You think I'd let you take him on \Nto protect us again? Get real.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.44,0:03:39.59,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,But he's dangerous.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.59,0:03:42.53,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,If you fight him, \Nyou'll be putting your lives at risk!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.53,0:03:45.07,DefaultItalics,AGEHA/ID,0,0,0,,There's no way I'm letting her go.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.64,0:03:52.34,DefaultItalics,AGEHA/ID,0,0,0,,I won't sit around telling myself it'll \Nbe okay while Amamiya fights ever again.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:52.77,0:03:56.59,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Fighting's our specialty. We've got this.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.57,0:04:00.86,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Do what you want.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.86,0:04:03.51,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Well, if you insist!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.71,0:04:07.38,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,What an embarrassment.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.38,0:04:11.21,Default,KABUTO,0,0,0,,She's crazy for wanting \Nto protect that guy.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.24,0:04:14.44,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Wait!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.44,0:04:16.66,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Why do I have to wait here?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.66,0:04:18.45,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I want to do something to help, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.45,0:04:20.45,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,There's not much you {\i1}can{\i0} do.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.45,0:04:23.14,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,But I'm bored!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.14,0:04:24.27,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,What are you, a kid?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.27,0:04:28.06,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,You've got the important job \Nof protecting the unwell.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.06,0:04:29.99,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Take care of Kirisaki.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.90,0:04:38.37,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Don't forget my advice, you two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.37,0:04:40.93,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,We're counting on you, Amamiya.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.93,0:04:46.81,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,We can't draw that thing's \Nattention while evading it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.47,0:04:48.47,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.95,0:04:53.73,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,If you die out there, \NI'll never forgive you.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.82,0:04:59.07,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,That was music to my ears.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.21,0:05:02.29,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,So, what's the plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.29,0:05:04.65,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,I'll go at him head-on.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.27,0:05:08.99,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You circle around and lock him down.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.99,0:05:11.33,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Seriously? What the hell is that?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:11.33,0:05:13.54,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Remember what Amamiya said.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:14.28,0:05:19.94,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Tatsuo-kun is using Rise to cover for \Nhis disabled body's lack of mobility.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:19.94,0:05:21.80,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,In close-quarters combat,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.80,0:05:27.06,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,he'll have to charge his Burst \Nwhile using Rise at full power.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.76,0:05:30.49,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,That'll create an opening.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.23,0:05:33.90,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,My Burst isn't reliable.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.90,0:05:40.37,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You're the only one who can lock him down \Nonce he's used up his PSI.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.37,0:05:43.09,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Do you have any idea \Nhow dangerous that'll be for you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.99,0:05:47.37,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You want to save Tatsuo, don't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.83,0:05:52.53,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Amamiya said it wasn't possible, \Nbut you haven't given up hope.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.02,0:05:55.91,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You want to bring him to his senses \Nand go home together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.92,0:05:59.76,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,So I'll do everything I can to help.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.84,0:06:02.30,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Yoshina...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.14,0:06:06.49,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Let's go!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.17,0:06:11.52,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Come here.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.45,0:06:15.28,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Time for a walk, worm boy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:16.55,0:06:17.80,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,They've started.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:21.40,0:06:23.79,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Good boy. This way.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.86,0:06:30.97,DefaultItalics,AGEHA/ID,0,0,0,,I feel good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:31.70,0:06:36.42,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Quit pumping that thing up \Nand come down here!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.42,0:06:39.17,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Spend some time with me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.21,0:06:43.77,DefaultItalics,AGEHA/ID,0,0,0,,One hit, and it's lights out.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.77,0:06:46.89,DefaultItalics,AGEHA/ID,0,0,0,,Find your courage, Yoshina Ageha!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.89,0:06:48.96,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Come at me, Tatsuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.13,0:06:51.39,Default,KABUTO,0,0,0,,Hey, wait.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.76,0:06:53.27,Default,KABUTO,0,0,0,,Where are you going?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.55,0:06:55.70,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,To the others, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:55.70,0:06:59.44,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,This is ridiculous. I can't just \Nsit around while they fight.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.44,0:07:04.85,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I'm definitely not just upset \Nbecause they wounded my pride.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.85,0:07:07.15,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,It's something I feel in my very soul.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.15,0:07:07.95,Default,KABUTO,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.95,0:07:12.17,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I simply can't stand by and watch \Nwhen there's danger in front of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:12.70,0:07:16.35,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,My endless curiosity is my identity.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.35,0:07:20.09,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,The time has come \Nto prove that I'm truly alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:20.09,0:07:21.75,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,It's my destiny!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.47,0:07:25.42,DefaultItalics,KABUTO/ID,0,0,0,,Oh, shit. This guy's an idiot.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.97,0:07:28.10,DefaultItalics,KABUTO/ID,0,0,0,,Well, I can't stop him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.80,DefaultItalics,KABUTO/ID,0,0,0,,Good luck, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.83,0:07:34.71,DefaultItalics,OBORO/ID,0,0,0,,Why do I feel so elated?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:34.71,0:07:37.21,DefaultItalics,OBORO/ID,0,0,0,,There's a power rising \Nfrom deep within my brain.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.21,0:07:39.15,DefaultItalics,OBORO/ID,0,0,0,,I feel like I've become a god.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.93,0:07:43.72,DefaultItalics,OBORO/ID,0,0,0,,Now go, Oboro, and set foot \Non this brave new world!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.47,0:07:47.70,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,Do you remember, Tatsuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:48.05,0:07:51.20,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,Back before you could ride a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.56,0:07:56.22,Flashback,YOUNG TATSUO,0,0,0,,I'm the only seven-year-old in the world \Nwho can't ride even with training wheels.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:56.22,0:07:57.79,Flashback,YOUNG TATSUO,0,0,0,,I want to die.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:57.79,0:07:59.38,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,Don't get so depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.38,0:08:01.29,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,I thought you were going to become a hero.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.61,0:08:03.98,Flashback,YOUNG TATSUO,0,0,0,,That's a pipe dream.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.98,0:08:05.55,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,Then here's what we'll do.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.88,0:08:09.65,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,If you can't run, I'll run for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:09.65,0:08:11.82,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,I'll fight for you, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.82,0:08:14.72,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,And you'll support me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.72,0:08:17.55,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,You'll be the brains, \Nand I'll be the body.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.55,0:08:19.48,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,Together, we'll be one.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.74,0:08:21.80,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,We're Team Miracle Dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.80,0:08:23.82,Flashback,YOUNG TATSUO,0,0,0,,Miracle Dragon?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:23.82,0:08:26.42,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,We're a dragon that \Ncan never be torn apart.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.42,0:08:29.63,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,When we're together, \Nyou can be a hero, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.36,0:08:32.07,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,Miracle Dragon...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.38,0:08:36.95,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,I couldn't even do a back-hip circle, \Nbut I tried to show off anyway.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.30,0:08:41.67,Flashback,YOUNG TATSUO,0,0,0,,Hiryu-niichan, don't forget me \Nafter you move.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:42.56,0:08:45.21,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,This is Miracle Dragon.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.62,0:08:47.71,Flashback,YOUNG TATSUO,0,0,0,,We'll see each other again, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.47,0:08:49.22,Flashback,YOUNG HIRYU,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.21,0:08:52.64,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,I've worked to change myself \Never since then
Dialogue: 0,0:08:53.10,0:08:56.77,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,so that I'd be able to hold my \Nhead high when we met again.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.40,0:08:59.70,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,So that I could become a hero with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.52,0:09:04.86,DefaultItalics,AGEHA/ID,0,0,0,,Rise lets him move like crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.53,0:09:10.86,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You might be faster, \Nbut your movements are sloppy.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.86,0:09:12.70,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You're not used to fighting.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.70,0:09:15.20,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You need to keep yourself more compact.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:17.68,0:09:20.62,DefaultItalics,AGEHA/ID,0,0,0,,Oh, shit. I got carried away.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:20.62,0:09:21.92,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Don't forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.18,0:09:24.80,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Prioritize evasion above all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.80,0:09:27.20,Flashback,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Normal attacks won't work against him.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:27.63,0:09:29.76,FlashbackItalics,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,If he catches you even once...
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.20,0:09:39.16,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,They say the hero always shows up late!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.44,0:09:45.90,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,This is our actual strategy!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.90,0:09:47.40,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Dragon Tail!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.12,0:09:56.11,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Tatsuo, I can't hold my head high yet, \Nbut this is my power!
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.20,0:09:59.76,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Be careful, Hiryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.33,0:10:11.76,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,Even if my skull shatters, I won't let go!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.76,0:10:16.01,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,I won't let you say you've forgotten me, \NTatsuo! It's me, Hiryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.01,0:10:19.52,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Your childhood friend, Asaga Hiryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:20.72,0:10:22.44,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,I came looking for you!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.44,0:10:24.81,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,I'm going to take you home!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:24.81,0:10:26.81,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Look me in the eye!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:27.18,0:10:30.48,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Return to your senses, Tatsuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:10:35.50,0:10:36.63,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,Hiryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:47.20,0:10:48.37,DefaultItalics,HIRYU/ID,0,0,0,,Tatsuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:51.75,0:10:53.55,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Are you back with us, Tatsuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:54.07,0:10:56.55,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,Hiryu-niichan.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:56.82,0:11:00.42,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,You've returned to your senses.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:00.42,0:11:05.51,Default,TATUO,0,0,0,,How'd the game go? \NYou hit a grand slam, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:05.92,0:11:08.12,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,What are you talking about?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:08.12,0:11:13.53,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,We promised we'd hang out \Nonce I learned to ride a bike.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:13.53,0:11:15.40,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,His memories...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.55,0:11:17.49,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Tatsuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:18.87,0:11:21.99,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,Who am I? Where am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:21.99,0:11:24.75,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,Hiryu-niichan, who am I?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.67,0:11:29.13,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Something's wrong! \NGet away from him, Hiryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.13,0:11:32.02,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,I'm right here! I'm staying right here!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:32.02,0:11:34.26,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Don't give in to yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:34.26,0:11:37.82,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,It's okay. You'll get better.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:37.82,0:11:40.64,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Your spirit isn't broken.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:40.95,0:11:43.02,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,We're going to become \Nheroes together, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:43.02,0:11:46.33,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,I'm the body, \Nand you're the brains, Tatsuo!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:46.33,0:11:47.81,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Reclaim yourself!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:48.23,0:11:51.06,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Together, we're one dragon!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.59,0:11:55.77,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Remember that pendant? I still have—
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.46,0:12:02.58,Default,HIRYU,0,0,0,,Let's... go home... Tatsuo...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:12.04,0:12:14.33,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Hiryu!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:44.38,0:12:46.12,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Get away from Hiryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.67,0:12:49.20,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Try to stop me, and I'll destroy you!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:50.72,0:12:51.79,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,This feeling...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.06,0:12:55.29,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,Yoshina? His PSI's so powerful.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:56.46,0:12:59.76,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,It's not trying to attack me. It's afraid.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:00.42,0:13:01.79,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,I'm free to move right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:02.97,0:13:04.86,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,I have a really bad feeling about this.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:11.85,0:13:16.47,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You're retreating? So you still know fear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.47,0:13:19.03,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Yoshina, stop! You'll destroy your brain!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:19.03,0:13:21.46,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,That doesn't matter!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.46,0:13:23.24,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Just take care of Hiryu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.50,0:13:24.39,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:25.73,0:13:26.98,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Asaga-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:27.63,0:13:29.97,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Asaga-kun! Asaga-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.97,0:13:32.02,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,He's not dead yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.02,0:13:34.52,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,I'll take care of this!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:34.52,0:13:35.04,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,But—
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.04,0:13:39.38,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Just go! He just finished reloading.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:39.82,0:13:45.27,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,That bastard was saving his strength \Nso he could trick us.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:45.85,0:13:46.81,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Amamiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:51.56,0:13:54.93,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,Amazing. He erased the Burst bullet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.93,0:13:57.19,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,No, he swallowed it.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.98,0:14:00.55,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Yoshina!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.55,0:14:04.06,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,That black sphere is Yoshina's Burst.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.06,0:14:07.83,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,It consumes everything it touches.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.53,0:14:11.34,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Amamiya, get away from here!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:11.34,0:14:13.41,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,I can't control it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:13.41,0:14:16.67,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,It keeps getting stronger, \Nand it won't stop moving.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.24,0:14:19.55,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,If you stay, it'll consume you, too!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:22.13,0:14:24.36,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Go, Amamiya!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.48,0:14:36.02,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,Look at it go.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.02,0:14:39.94,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,If I'd stayed, I would've died \Nwithout leaving a trace.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:40.44,0:14:45.32,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,But why did it protect me \Nif Yoshina can't control it?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.01,0:14:48.33,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,Does it respond to PSI?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.56,0:15:17.70,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Yoshina.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:18.30,0:15:19.74,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Yoshina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:24.96,0:15:26.95,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,It seems I was a bit late.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.32,0:15:30.82,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,You're certainly full of surprises.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.82,0:15:34.22,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Your power is destruction incarnate.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.22,0:15:37.13,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I came all the way here, \Nbut there was nothing for me to do.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.13,0:15:40.02,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,No matter. At the next opportunity,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:40.02,0:15:45.26,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I shall demonstrate the fantastic power \Nstirring inside me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:45.53,0:15:48.24,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,PSI, huh? The mere thought excites me.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.28,0:15:50.72,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Hey, what's wrong?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:51.19,0:15:52.26,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Yoshina-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.64,0:15:53.77,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Yoshina!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.77,0:15:56.62,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,No... Are you dying?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.62,0:15:58.60,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Are you going to die here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:58.90,0:16:00.61,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,You can't! This isn't fair!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.61,0:16:04.23,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,We only just met! Why do you have to die?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:04.23,0:16:06.29,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I won't allow it.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.29,0:16:10.13,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Mochizuki Oboro's life was \Njust about to get interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.71,0:16:13.70,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Not a single piece can be missing.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.62,0:16:17.33,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,It's not interesting if you die!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.42,0:16:26.06,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I sensed you were a key piece to making \Nthe puzzle that is my life interesting.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.06,0:16:28.59,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,You must live, because I want you to!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:29.14,0:16:31.90,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,That's... Cure!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.17,0:16:37.35,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Did I fall asleep?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.35,0:16:39.70,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,My head suddenly felt light.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.15,0:16:43.01,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,You nearly died after \Nyour brain was damaged.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.73,0:16:46.62,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I'm glad you're feeling better, \NYoshina-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.83,0:16:51.16,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,What did you do to me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:51.16,0:16:52.95,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I healed you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.95,0:16:56.61,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I suppose this means \Nmy own powers have awakened.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:58.06,0:16:59.22,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,What is this?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:59.22,0:17:03.28,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Cure, the ability to share \Nyour own Rise with others.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.07,0:17:06.64,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,It's a type of PSI that only \Na chosen few can master.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.55,0:17:10.38,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,I'm glad. I'm so glad.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.38,0:17:12.55,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Didn't I tell you not to die out there?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:12.55,0:17:15.68,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Don't cry. I came back, didn't I?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:15.68,0:17:17.72,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,I don't break my promises.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.72,0:17:19.62,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Easy to say in hindsight!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:19.62,0:17:20.89,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You don't get it, dummy.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:20.89,0:17:23.65,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Even fate is on my side.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.11,0:17:26.74,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,I don't like arguing with Yoshina.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.74,0:17:31.22,DefaultItalics,AMAMIYA/ID,0,0,0,,He's stupid, so he doesn't understand \Nthings like feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:31.65,0:17:34.62,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Ageha-kun, may I stop healing him now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.62,0:17:36.95,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,What? Is he all better now?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.95,0:17:38.97,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Not yet, but I'm getting bored.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.97,0:17:39.93,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Don't stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.93,0:17:41.50,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,How do you get bored so quickly?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.50,0:17:44.58,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Now that I think about it, \NI have the right to choose!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:44.58,0:17:48.40,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I want to hold the person I want \Nto hold when I want to hold them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:48.40,0:17:50.25,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,We don't have time for nonsense!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:50.25,0:17:52.46,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,If we don't hurry, the worm—
Dialogue: 0,0:17:54.97,0:17:56.24,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Shit!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:56.87,0:17:57.78,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,All right.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:59.81,0:18:00.92,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,You!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:00.92,0:18:02.21,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Tatsuo-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:08.34,0:18:10.63,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,That attack of yours really hurt.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:11.19,0:18:16.24,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,I lost my powers, but because \Nof that, I reclaimed my mind.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.24,0:18:19.62,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,This thing had sealed away my personality.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.62,0:18:22.77,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,Thanks to you, I'm finally free.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:23.21,0:18:25.53,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Have you really returned to your senses?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.53,0:18:28.06,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,It's okay. I can tell.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:28.06,0:18:30.35,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,This thing is a part of me now.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:30.79,0:18:34.48,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,It felt like I was along for the ride \Nin someone else's body,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.48,0:18:38.47,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,but everything I did \Nhas been burned into my eyes.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:38.89,0:18:42.54,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,Asaga-san, what I did can't be undone.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:43.30,0:18:44.35,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,I'm sorry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.83,0:18:46.64,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,It's my fault this happened.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:48.58,0:18:51.36,DefaultItalics,TATSUO/ID,0,0,0,,That's our...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:51.78,0:18:56.11,DefaultItalics,TATSUO/ID,0,0,0,,Thank you for coming after me.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:56.11,0:18:57.70,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Don't worry.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.32,0:19:00.57,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I'll heal him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:00.57,0:19:04.88,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Tatsuo-kun, the Taboo embedded \Nthat core when they captured you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:05.39,0:19:07.42,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Do you remember what happened after that?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.57,0:19:10.80,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,Only bits and pieces.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.80,0:19:13.77,Flashback,DOLKEY,0,0,0,,Eliminate all the intruders!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.77,0:19:17.80,Flashback,DOLKEY,0,0,0,,Kill all the PSI users who defy us!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:18.28,0:19:20.99,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,There's a human leading the Taboo?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:20.99,0:19:23.57,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,I've been here ever since.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.24,0:19:30.86,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,I periodically regained consciousness and\Nfelt relief—or despair—at being alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:32.35,0:19:36.43,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,I've closed the wound, \Nbut that's all I can do for him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.43,0:19:39.47,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,He's not waking up. This is bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.47,0:19:41.90,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,We should return \Nto the present day quickly.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:41.90,0:19:43.29,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Let's go to the gate.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:50.47,0:19:52.36,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Get out your cards, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:52.36,0:19:53.84,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Oh, right. Tatsuo.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:53.84,0:19:55.38,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,I have one.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.91,0:19:56.63,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,I see.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.62,0:20:00.39,Default,KABUTO,0,0,0,,Do we put our cards in here?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:00.39,0:20:01.18,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:06.26,0:20:07.52,Default,KABUTO,0,0,0,,Is that...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:11.44,Signs,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&HB8CADE&\3c&H637198&\bord2\pos(292,122.5)}CARD BALANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:11.44,Signs,SIGN LEFT,0,0,0,,{\fs10\c&HB8CADE&\3c&H637198&\bord2\pos(292,199.5)}COIN BALANCE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:11.44,Signs,SIGN RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs14\b0\c&H8A9AB7&\pos(403,151)}DIAL NUMBER
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:11.44,Signs,SIGN BOTTOM LEFT,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs14\b0\c&H8A9AB7&\pos(291.5,280)}POWER
Dialogue: 0,0:20:09.19,0:20:11.44,Signs,SIGN BOTTOM RIGHT,0,0,0,,{\blur0.2\fs14\b0\c&H8A9AB7&\pos(536,280)}NOTE
Dialogue: 0,0:20:18.57,0:20:20.55,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,You and Asaga-kun are next.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.55,0:20:24.08,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Could you hold the receiver? \NI'll insert Hiryu's card.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:33.75,0:20:35.75,Default,TATSUO,0,0,0,,Thank you. Goodbye.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.75,0:20:36.55,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:38.34,0:20:39.63,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Are you—
Dialogue: 0,0:20:43.42,0:20:44.61,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,That idiot!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.61,0:20:45.89,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,What the hell was that?!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.67,0:20:49.07,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Tatsuo doesn't have a card!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:49.07,0:20:50.22,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Why did he lie?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:50.22,0:20:52.40,Default,KABUTO,0,0,0,,Then he can't come back.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:52.40,0:20:55.18,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,He didn't want us to know that.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:58.29,0:21:00.95,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,Where are we? We're back, aren't we?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:00.95,0:21:03.25,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,Oboro, what happened to Tatsuo?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.25,0:21:05.68,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,He left.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:06.16,0:21:08.78,Default,AMAMIYA,0,0,0,,Why didn't he tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.78,0:21:11.17,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,He must've said something about it, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:12.04,0:21:13.11,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,No.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.11,0:21:15.63,Flashback,TATSUO,0,0,0,,I can tell my death is approaching.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:15.97,0:21:18.39,Flashback,TATSUO,0,0,0,,This orb is losing power.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:18.93,0:21:20.88,Flashback,TATSUO,0,0,0,,When it does, I'll die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.88,0:21:24.72,Flashback,OBORO,0,0,0,,Unfortunately, I don't think \NI can remove it.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:24.72,0:21:25.90,Flashback,TATSUO,0,0,0,,That's fine.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:25.90,0:21:30.72,Flashback,TATSUO,0,0,0,,I just don't want to die in front of \NYoshina-kun. Not after he saved me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.72,0:21:33.35,Flashback,TATSUO,0,0,0,,I don't want him to feel \Nresponsible for my death.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:34.45,0:21:38.30,Default,OBORO,0,0,0,,He probably didn't want \Nto cause any more trouble.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:39.09,0:21:40.44,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,But...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:41.11,0:21:43.43,Default,AGEHA,0,0,0,,What are we supposed to tell Hiryu?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:44.44,0:21:45.12,DefaultItalics,TATSUO/ID,0,0,0,,Asaga-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:45.76,0:21:48.12,DefaultItalics,TATSUO/ID,0,0,0,,I don't intend to just lie down and die.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.71,0:21:51.17,DefaultItalics,TATSUO/ID,0,0,0,,There may yet be a way for me to survive.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:51.75,0:21:55.64,DefaultItalics,TATSUO/ID,0,0,0,,I will find that way in this world.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.38,0:21:57.96,DefaultItalics,TATSUO/ID,0,0,0,,Wait for me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:58.35,0:22:03.23,DefaultItalics,TATSUO/ID,0,0,0,,I'll come back to you on my own two legs.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:05.18,0:22:08.69,Credits,CREDITS,0,0,0,,Translation: Sho Stifler
Dialogue: 0,0:22:09.06,0:22:12.56,Credits,CREDITS,0,0,0,,Subtitle Timing: Krzysztof Kunc\NEditing & Typesetting: Geoff Mazzolini
Dialogue: 0,0:22:12.82,0:22:16.32,Credits,CREDITS,0,0,0,,Quality Check: Zachary Carlysle\NTranslation Check: David Saylor
